# TLC model-checker working artifacts: the states/ fingerprint+queue
# directories are regenerated on every run and must never be committed; the *.bin
# TTrace dumps (covered by *.bin above) are opaque and version-fragile — the
# reproducible counterexamples are the committed seeded-bug cfgs + recipe instead
# (spec/ConsensusSpec-ackonappend.cfg, spec/SnapshotInstallSpec-truncatebeforepersist.cfg).
spec/states/
